# Run in a nested lit by ../../../../copts-expect.test: a %{msil_prog} test
# that adds compile flags with %{msil_copts} and names a shared expected file
# with %{msil_expect} (M23); there is no copts.expected, only shared.expected.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && split-file %s %t
